 "notModeled": [
  "analog inputs, multiplexer and internal 2.5 V reference (REFOUT never driven): every conversion returns the 0 V differential code 000h",
  "the four output registers (A0, B0, A1, B1) and the RD read pointer: the first RD falling edge after CONVST outputs converter A, the second converter B, with A0 choosing input 0 or 1; the model outputs the same 0 V code on every read, so the A/B/0/1 order is not visible",
  "RD toggles advance the read pointer even with CS high (channel swap); not modeled",
  "the conversion is clocked by the external CLOCK (16 cycles from the first CLOCK rising edge after CONVST falls, Figure 10); the model uses tCONV 1.75 us at tCKP = 125 ns, starting at CONVST falling",
